#: ../../maths/greeks.md:1 ad50d644bf8c463cb2d1cdc13ddc1813
msgid "Greeks and the other result kinds"
msgstr "希臘字母與其他結果"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:3 ee60d732f7584c5fa49583aabf09c791
msgid "Nineteen result kinds are served. Fifteen of them are derivatives of the price; four are quantities of a different sort — a probability, an implied volatility, a fair rate and a basis-point value."
msgstr "本服務提供十九種結果。其中十五種是價格的導數；另外四種是不同性質的量——一個機率、一個隱含波動率、一個公平利率，以及一個基點價值。"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:7 a11d1cb3ba484ff283cdd2d685419e0b
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Every formula below is the European analytic case, which is what QuantLib's `BlackCalculator` computes (`ql/pricingengines/blackcalculator.cpp`). Other engines either differentiate their own solution or **do not publish the quantity at all**, which is why so many rows come back \"not supplied\" ({doc}`../results`)."
msgstr "以下每個公式都是歐式解析解的情形，也就是 QuantLib 的 `BlackCalculator`（`ql/pricingengines/blackcalculator.cpp`）所計算的內容。其他引擎要嘛對自己的解求導，要嘛**根本不發布該量**，這也是為什麼有那麼多列回來是「未提供」（{doc}`../results`）。"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:13 636e870c834541ac9c64e2a033281574
msgid "The derivatives"
msgstr "各項導數"

