#: ../../maths/greeks.md:34 5b8ba5fc7b374af890b95bcb15dc9b7a
msgid "**Delta forward** is the delta with respect to the forward rather than the spot, which is the hedge ratio you want when the hedge instrument is a forward rather than the stock. The two differ by the carry: $\\partial V/\\partial S = (D_q/D_r)\\,\\partial V/\\partial F$."
msgstr "**遠期 delta** 是對遠期價而非現貨的 delta，也就是當避險工具是遠期合約而不是股票時你要的避險比率。兩者差在持有成本：$\\partial V/\\partial S = (D_q/D_r)\\,\\partial V/\\partial F$。"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:39 c3d137f59437451fa6928e5b3b879880
msgid "**Elasticity** is delta scaled into a percentage-for-percentage figure: how many percent the option moves for one percent on the underlying. It is large and negative for out-of-the-money puts, and it is the natural units for comparing options of very different premiums."
msgstr "**彈性**把 delta 換算成百分比對百分比的數字：標的每動百分之一，選擇權動百分之幾。對價外賣權而言它又大又負，而它是比較權利金差異極大的選擇權時最自然的單位。"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:44 20ed9c165b8842eb9b30259c4448a36d
msgid "**Theta per day** is simply the annual figure divided by 365 — a calendar convention, not a day count. Over a weekend the realised decay is three of these, not one."
msgstr "**每日 theta** 就只是年化值除以 365——一種曆日慣例，不是日計方式。跨過一個週末，實現的耗損是三個這樣的量，不是一個。"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:48 821bb394cfd64129bb5eae495d5ec2aa
msgid "The probability"
msgstr "機率"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:50 89ca4049f5d54d0daef1ef58db7d424c
#, python-brace-format
msgid "\\text{ITM cash probability} = N(d_2)\\ \\text{(call)},\\qquad N(-d_2)\\ \\text{(put)}."
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:52 ecfd8c58d4c34a8baf4b434da599140f
msgid "This is the risk-neutral probability that the option finishes in the money — which is also, up to the discount factor, the price of a cash-or-nothing option paying one unit. It is *not* a real-world probability: it carries the risk-neutral drift $r-q$, not the asset's expected return."
msgstr "這是選擇權到期落在價內的風險中立機率——它同時也是（差一個折現因子）支付一單位現金的現金或零選擇權的價格。它*不是*真實世界的機率：它帶的是風險中立漂移 $r-q$，不是資產的預期報酬。"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:57 6a67e759e072401d8216c370af037a0c
msgid "Implied volatility"
msgstr "隱含波動率"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:59 3a325c4db51f4077abb4540041b75e88
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The only result computed from an input the request carries rather than from the market. Given a target price $V^{\\ast}$, it solves"
msgstr "唯一由請求自帶的輸入、而非由市場算出的結果。給定目標價格 $V^{\\ast}$，它求解"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:62 35b9146cada34d71a4a936d3de249ff9
#, python-brace-format
msgid "\\sigma^{\\ast}: \\quad V(\\sigma^{\\ast}) = V^{\\ast}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:64 7b5d3263570e4da7ac7c8e25aa09ce38
msgid "by a bracketed root find (QuantLib uses Brent). The price is strictly increasing in $\\sigma$ for a vanilla, so the root is unique when it exists; a target outside the no-arbitrage range has no root and the search fails rather than returning a boundary value."
msgstr "以帶區間的求根法解出（QuantLib 使用 Brent 法）。對一般型而言價格對 $\\sigma$ 嚴格遞增，因此根存在時是唯一的；目標價落在無套利範圍之外時無解，搜尋會失敗，而不是回傳一個邊界值。"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:69 518b4627a53f4d3e896d4efad2a744fb
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Supply the bracket and tolerance if the default search is too wide or too loose. QuantLib can invert a vanilla, a barrier and a double barrier; on any other style the kind comes back named absent. See {doc}`numerics` for what the root find costs."
msgstr "若預設的搜尋範圍太寬或容忍度太鬆，請自行提供區間與容忍度。QuantLib 能反推一般型、障礙與雙障礙；其他任何類型上，該種類會被指名為缺席。求根的代價見 {doc}`numerics`。"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:74 9bdf5df9eae74a3d8fd39f7637bb4134
msgid "The quanto trio"
msgstr "quanto 三兄弟"

