msgid "qrho"
msgstr "qrho"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md 4c4ffa1a69c74e0eb42406da04c9558c
msgid "$\\partial V/\\partial r_f$, the foreign risk-free rate"
msgstr "$\\partial V/\\partial r_f$，外幣無風險利率"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md 16e181ea2a274c0a9520d0df324f4808
msgid "qvega"
msgstr "qvega"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md 4af4a64dbe1e4e70b3c4b73f964d7b62
msgid "$\\partial V/\\partial \\sigma_X$, the FX volatility"
msgstr "$\\partial V/\\partial \\sigma_X$，匯率波動率"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md 5b3f640acd724408927591b6791e7b37
msgid "qlambda"
msgstr "qlambda"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md 858d1b247ccd4159bdf32da24cad9476
msgid "$\\partial V/\\partial \\rho$, the correlation between asset and FX rate"
msgstr "$\\partial V/\\partial \\rho$，資產與匯率之間的相關係數"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:85 0d5edeee28754e62887733147df5e6a3
msgid "They exist because the quanto adjustment enters the drift through exactly those three quantities, so their derivatives are the risk of the adjustment itself. On a non-quanto trade they come back unavailable."
msgstr "它們之所以存在，是因為 quanto 調整正是透過這三個量進入漂移項，所以它們的導數就是這項調整本身的風險。在非 quanto 交易上，它們回來時標為無法提供。"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:89 34968b3a73a54b3f93fb54c821a3f555
msgid "The swap kinds"
msgstr "利率交換相關的結果"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md b2e649603ee94cf3905819599097c729
msgid "fair rate"
msgstr "公平利率"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md 1df5204e9a254be481d62d45a3a12cb7
msgid "The fixed rate that makes the swap worth zero"
msgstr "使該筆交換價值為零的固定利率"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md fb5fb36487704d9087ed6dc2a140384a
msgid "leg NPV"
msgstr "各腳淨現值"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md 8acff38cde8d497191a821c1f99f651e
msgid "The present value of one leg"
msgstr "單一計息腳的現值"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md 88fff7f4ae874f31acdaa36c8b9de0bc
msgid "leg BPS"
msgstr "各腳 BPS"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md 90d5c27d583141d7bc4e2b4957e21c9a
msgid "The value of one basis point on a leg"
msgstr "單一計息腳上一個基點的價值"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:97 c8b97821a2154b5282645b35ed08b2ad
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The formulas are in {doc}`rates`. The fair rate needs exactly two legs, fixed first, then Ibor: any other arrangement is refused rather than answered off the wrong leg."
msgstr "公式見 {doc}`rates`。公平利率需要恰好兩腳，固定腳在前、Ibor 腳在後：其他任何排列都會被拒絕，而不是拿錯的那一腳算給你。"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:101 e43fd54bc646447cbeb18b16da89ff13
msgid "Why a greek is missing"
msgstr "為什麼少了某個希臘字母"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:103 e46368cb07e948a383e82c62c47c2cc5
msgid "An engine publishes what its solution gives it cheaply. The analytic European engine differentiates its closed form and has everything above. A binomial tree has delta, gamma and theta from the nodes around the root and **no vega**, because volatility is not a state variable in the tree. The American approximations publish almost nothing beyond the price."
msgstr "引擎只發布它的解能便宜給出的東西。歐式解析解引擎對自己的封閉解求導，因此上面每一項都有。二元樹從樹根附近的節點得到 delta、gamma 與 theta，卻**沒有 vega**，因為波動率不是樹裡的狀態變數。美式近似法除了價格之外幾乎什麼都不發布。"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:109 db597ab7b8b14db799856df146f1b79b
msgid "If you need a greek an engine will not give you, the honest options are to price the same trade on an analytic engine — reading the engine echo on both — or to bump the market yourself with a sweep and difference the ladder, which is a finite-difference greek and says so."
msgstr "若你需要某個引擎不給的希臘字母，誠實的做法有兩個：用解析解引擎為同一筆交易計價——並讀兩邊的引擎回音——或是自己用掃描推動市場，再對階梯圖取差分，那就是一個有限差分的希臘字母，而且它明說自己是。"

